# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the Linux XCTest harness (see Tests/check-leaks.sh).
# Matched against mangled symbols (addr2line symbolizer). Keep these narrow:
# a pattern matches if it appears in ANY frame of a leak stack.
#
# XCTWaiter.wait leaks a weak-reference side table; every other leak record is
# an XCTest-owned object (test runs, test-case instances) reachable only from it.
leak:6XCTest9XCTWaiterC4wait
